        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Billy Idol\n- Bands: Stiltskin, Genesis\n- Albums: Live and Acoustic\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Idol was born as William Michael Albert Broad on 30 November 1955.\n- Billy Idol is an English musician, singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968.\n- Ray Wilson is a Scottish musician.\n- Ray Wilson is best known as the vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin.\n- Ray Wilson was a member of Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- Live and Acoustic is the first live CD release by Ray Wilson.",
